---
<Doc slug={slug} title="Quick start">
  <h1>Quick start</h1>
  <p>Build the Go CLI, select a model in cortex, and configure the provider in axon.</p>

  <h2>Build</h2>
  <pre><code>git clone https://github.com/atakang7/cortex.git
cd cortex
go build -o cortex ./cmd/cortex
./cortex --version</code></pre>

  <h2>Configure OpenRouter</h2>
  <p>On Linux or macOS, create a minimal axon provider file and a cortex model selection:</p>
  <pre><code>mkdir -p ~/.config/axon ~/.config/cortex
cat &gt; ~/.config/axon/axon.yaml &lt;&lt;'YAML'
providers:
  openrouter:
    base_url: https://openrouter.ai/api
    api_key: &#36;&#123;OPENROUTER_API_KEY&#125;
    models:
      deepseek/deepseek-v3.2:
YAML
cp .env.example ~/.config/axon/.env
chmod 600 ~/.config/axon/.env
printf 'provider: openrouter\nmodel: deepseek/deepseek-v3.2\n' &gt; ~/.config/cortex/config.yaml</code></pre>
  <p>Replace the placeholder in <code>~/.config/axon/.env</code> with a real key. Do not commit that file.</p>

  <h2>Run</h2>
  <pre><code>./cortex
./cortex --prompt "summarize the TODOs"
./cortex --config reviewer.yaml --prompt "review the last commit"</code></pre>
  <p><code>--prompt</code> writes the answer to stdout and progress to stderr. <code>--config</code> reads only the named cortex config and environment overrides.</p>

  <div class="docs-pager"><Pager slug={slug} /></div>
</Doc>
